:"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","review_id":"WjRDQG5Q2j90VInNVHh5Ow","date":"2016-02-19T20:28:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939288854598999,"text_excerpt":"This place is amazing. There has to be over 100 types of soda here, tons of taffy, and a plethora of candy. I saw candy from my childhood and the Japanese make your own candy. If you don't leave with something after walking in, you're missing out. Can't wait to come back again."},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","review_id":"O5q0L1fFYAsBzqF5F-jMJQ","date":"2019-07-23T02:17:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9366613626480103,"text_excerpt":"Very interesting candy/soda store! Love the decor and choice of music they play. So many different soda types and candies! Love the walls of these funny posters/signage(?). Also love it how you walk in and a blast of cold AC hits your body cooling you down. My sister loved it and bought herself a large bag of candy. So many different flavors such as mango, lemon lime, cookies and cream, margarita, orange, strawberry cheesecake, etc. I believe they are taffies. Definitely would recommend this place to see the different types of sodas and candies. I didn't imagine many different flavors and brands there are for just sodas."},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","review_id":"Wqm4ozeEZhjFrTgcElW3Gw","date":"2019-06-21T05:27:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9340840578079224,"text_excerpt":"This place is fun to look around in. I saw many fun gift ideas!! Candy and soda is their thing, but there are toys, flasks, bacon soap, and cool retro items. It was fun to shop around and see candy from when I was little and also new candy flavors! Staff was super nice and friendly, it's obvious that they love their shop."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","photo_id":"Y5TaX7Ll1E6YA4bwW9bjzg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y5TaX7Ll1E6YA4bwW9bjzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9204371571540833},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","photo_id":"ykOknMNznqmTxh4PyJrWOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ykOknMNznqmTxh4PyJrWOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8987773060798645},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","photo_id":"Yc_F12o62OriFbLkYnhhIA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Yc_F12o62OriFbLkYnhhIA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8490535020828247},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","photo_id":"zPdvl0kMEJVTMoIy9ou1KA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zPdvl0kMEJVTMoIy9ou1KA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8015552759170532},{"business_id":"fHYu0otyReBOVXb1WI_YIg","photo_id":"wNt9G-7igK5uwldel7e84g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wNt9G-7igK5uwldel7e84g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7327331900596619}]},"notebook_case":null}
